    "describe_ch": "本課程提供修習飛行課程之學生一基本航行知識，課程內容包括1. 學習使用各式航空用圖表.;2 學習使用不同的航行計算尺作一航行計劃; 3.介紹各式無線電航行系統。",
    "describe_eh": "Develop an understanding of the fundamental concepts in aviation navigation, Topics covered include: 1. Learn to use different aeronautical chart 2. Learn to know the different type of flight computer used in flight planning. 3. Introduce radio navigation systems available for cross-country flight.",
